      "text": "[9:06PM] #OjoduBerger #TrafficUpdate \n\nLagos-Ibadan Expressway is clear in both directions. \nKey stretches like Isheri Olowora to Omole Junction and Wempco to Lateef Jakande are fast-moving. \nThe return journey from Wempco to Odo Eran and Caterpillar is also flowing well. \nTraffic officers are on ground ensuring the situation remains stable. \nOverall, traffic movement is appreciable and unhindered.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
