      "text": "[9:45PM] #Ogolonto #TrafficUpdate \n\nItanwolo to Orita Aje is moving well but slows near Ogoloto intersection. \nTraffic towards Aunty Kenny is smooth, while Agric area is a bit slow due to commercial activities. \nMovement towards Haruno and the return journey to Ogoloto and Itanwolo is good. Other routes like Ogoloto to Obasekumade Road and Police Post to General Hospital are also flowing well.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
