      "text": "[10:33PM] #Imota_Ikorodu #TrafficUpdate \n\nMovement at Imota has fully normalized, with all major routes and intersections experiencing smooth movement. \nCommuters can expect clear roads from Sabo Roundabout to Itamaga, Itamaga to Agbowa, and along routes such as Itamaga Roundabout to Ijede and Elepe to Gberigbe.\n\nWith no reported congestion or impediments, traffic is flowing freely in both directions, ensuring a hassle-free journey for all road users within the axis.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
